translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_0b620d89:

    # "You come across a carrot plant underneath the grass."
    "你在草丛下发现了一株胡萝卜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_17da5b77:

    # "You picked up a carrot, the plant will probably replenish in a few hours."
    "你捡起一根胡萝卜，这株植物大概几小时后就会重新长出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_d90591c2:

    # "There doesn't seem to be any carrot in this plant, maybe come back later..."
    "这株植物里似乎没有胡萝卜了，也许晚点再来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_9b2f2b1b:

    # "You are not sure... if you should leave with the flower in your hand."
    "你不确定……是否该拿着手里的花离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_2dd49d8c:

    # msg "Do you want to leave the area, states of the dungeon will not be saved." nointeract
    msg "你想离开这个区域吗？离开后，地牢的状态将不会保存。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_a878fa1e:

    # "Reading... the sign carefully, you notice there is a few lines hidden in the corner of the sign."
    "你仔细阅读告示，注意到告示角落里藏着几行字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_1e81db67:

    # "It says..."
    "上面写着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_057b2615:

    # "{i}To receive the bow of the hunter, one must place barrels around a true carrot in all sides and corners...{/i}"
    "{i}要获得猎人的弓，必须在一根真正的胡萝卜四周以及所有角落放置木桶……{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_b5709d4d:

    # "The carrot plant near the sign suddenly convulses..."
    "告示旁的胡萝卜植株突然抽搐起来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_808f81da:

    # "A hunting bow drops from the carrot plant, you thank whoever is granting you the gift, and pick it up."
    "一把猎弓从胡萝卜植株上掉落下来。你向赐予你这份礼物的人道谢，然后将它捡起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_3ec1d6c4:

    # "It seems you already own the bow, the bush slowly stops convulsing..."
    "看来你已经拥有这把弓了，灌木丛慢慢停止抽搐……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_56bc5980:

    # "There seems to be something underneath the text, maybe you should come back later... after visiting the cavern."
    "文字下面似乎有什么东西，也许你在去过洞窟之后再回来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_509dcf5e:

    # "The flower withers in your hand..."
    "你手中的花枯萎了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_cc558204:

    # "There is a flower... on the ground."
    "地上有一朵花……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_f093c0a7:

    # "You notice the bush is blocking the pathway in front of you..."
    "你注意到灌木丛挡住了面前的道路……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_08d1e649:

    # "There's a small drawing in the middle of the bush..."
    "灌木丛中央有一幅小画……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_bb0ec76a:

    # "Something... flower. And something... in the pot?"
    "什么……花。还有什么……在罐子里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_e4bc7423:

    # "You quickly put the drawing back, perhaps there's something that can remove this bush."
    "你赶紧把画放了回去，也许有什么东西能移开这片灌木丛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_6fbeccd5:

    # "You enter the northeast of the split trail."
    "你进入了分岔小径的东北方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_9b2f2b1b_1:

    # "You are not sure... if you should leave with the flower in your hand."
    "你不确定……是否该拿着手里的花离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_1635364a:

    # "You reach into the pathway in front of you, it seems to lead to the deeper part of the forest..."
    "你走上面前的小路，似乎通向森林深处……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_5a996af5:

    # "You follow the step... eventually, you notice an old well in front of you..."
    "你沿着这条路走……最终，你注意到前方有一口古井……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_d89d2071:

    # "You walk into the slumbrous well."
    "你走进了沉眠之井。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_9b2f2b1b_2:

    # "You are not sure... if you should leave with the flower in your hand."
    "你拿着手中的花，不确定是否该离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_1635364a_1:

    # "You reach into the pathway in front of you, it seems to lead to the deeper part of the forest..."
    "你走上面前的小路，似乎通向森林深处……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_dac3171f:

    # "You follow the step... eventually, you see a cave in front of you..."
    "你沿着这条路走……最终，你看到前方有一处洞窟……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_58eda9c8:

    # "You walk towards the cavern entrance..."
    "你朝洞窟入口走去……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_52786787:

    # "There is a pot on the grass..."
    "草地上有一口锅……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Loop_942390d6:

    # "It seems that a path has unlocked..."
    "似乎有一条路开放了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Werewolf_7b7a5e55:

    # "As you walk through the forest, you encountered a werewolf."
    "你穿过森林时，遇到了一只狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Werewolf_aa740c79:

    # "Immediately, you begin to run towards the opposite direction, but soon a dark figure comes into your view."
    "你立刻开始朝相反方向跑去，但很快，一个黑影映入眼帘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Werewolf_f7dd4053:

    # e "Fuck..."
    e "操……"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Caproot_0b620d89:

    # "You come across a carrot plant underneath the grass."
    "你在草丛下发现了一株胡萝卜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Caproot_4f2b7598:

    # "As you pick up the carrot, it appears that it takes a little more strength to pull out."
    "你拔起胡萝卜时，发现似乎还要多费一点力气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Caproot_3daaa82a:

    # "You use the strength of your body to pull up the carrot, only to clumsily fall on the ground."
    "你使出浑身力气拔起胡萝卜，却笨拙地摔倒在地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Caproot_4aef5d77:

    # "As you look up, you only see the carrot begins to strech itself... it is definitely not a carrot."
    "你抬头一看，只见胡萝卜开始伸展开来……这绝对不是胡萝卜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Split_Trail_Caproot_827cb48b:

    # "The Caproot monster is now almost bigger than twice your size... you need to defend yourself."
    "卡普鲁特怪物如今几乎有你的两倍大……你得自卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Enter_ebd85903:

    # "The... entrance to the cave seems to be blocked for now..."
    "洞窟的……入口目前似乎被堵住了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_88c40028:

    # "You jump into the water and quickly leave the cave..."
    "你跳入水中，迅速离开了洞窟……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_9cdb018f:

    # "You look back, Wuldon and Vurro are still working, you have to be quick before returning to them again."
    "你回头看去，伍尔顿和伏罗仍在忙碌；你得快点，之后还要再回到他们身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_c4ff8585:

    # "You find a small hole partway up the wall at the end of the cavern. Judging by the small pile of rocks at its foot, it was revealed after the cavern collapsed."
    "你在洞窟尽头的墙壁半腰处发现一个小洞。看它脚边那小堆石头，应该是在洞窟坍塌后露出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_e6d22e0b:

    # msg "Work in Progress!"
    msg "制作中！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_499a581c:

    # "There's still monsters nearby, you decide it's better not to get yourself stuck while the nosferats... swing their meat around the cave."
    "附近仍有怪物，你觉得最好别让自己困在这里，免得那些诺斯费拉图……在洞窟里挥舞着肉棒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_717f859c:

    # "Deciding you shouldn't go in for now, you turn around to keep exploring for a while."
    "你决定暂时不进去，于是转身继续探索了一阵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_3dc67d59:

    # "You look at the rubble in front of you..."
    "你看着面前的瓦砾……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_a28bc05d:

    # "It doesn't seem like you can fit through it at all."
    "你根本没法从中钻过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_4002b44e:

    # "You try to look at the Feral Werewolf... It is much different than the normal werewolves you're encountered..."
    "你试着看清这头狂化狼人……它和你遇到过的普通狼人截然不同……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_9de04ace:

    # "The monster in front of you, there's a lack of compassion in his face... only beastly instinct."
    "你面前的怪物脸上没有一丝怜悯……只有野兽般的本能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_cf0329a9:

    # "You remember Wuldon telling you about his past... and seeing the lifeless husk of a man like him now, only brings you grief and remorse..."
    "你想起伍尔顿曾告诉你他的过去……如今看到一个和他一样的男人只剩下毫无生气的躯壳，不禁感到悲痛和悔恨……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_77d72b5d:

    # "Whoever he was, it doesn't matter now."
    "不管他曾经是谁，现在都已经不重要了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_bccb361f:

    # "The beast howls."
    "野兽仰天长啸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_c3797b68:

    # "It sprints towards you with full force, there's no time to think now..."
    "它全力朝你冲来，现在已经没有时间思考了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_32931211:

    # "The entrance has been sealed tight since the cave-in from your last visit..."
    "自你上次来时发生塌方后，洞窟入口就被彻底封死了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_7c732532:

    # "You look at the tight hole in front of you, you notice there's a moving figure on the other side of the rubble..."
    "你看向面前狭窄的洞口，注意到碎石的另一侧有个身影正在移动……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_721bf256:

    # "The hole in front of you is too small to fit through."
    "你面前的洞口太小了，根本钻不过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_13094814:

    # "Perhaps... if you have enough Agility, you can maybe fit through the hole..."
    "也许……如果你的敏捷足够高，或许就能钻过这个洞口……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_cd2e94dc:

    # "But it's very possible you might get stuck in the hole while the figure is approaching you."
    "但那道身影正朝你靠近，你很可能会卡在洞里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_63ec601c:

    # "You crawl into the tight hole, exhaling all air inside of you..."
    "你爬进狭窄的洞口，把体内的空气全都呼了出去……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_8a600863:

    # "Regardless of how much you breath, you soon realises you cannot make it."
    "无论怎么呼吸，你很快就意识到自己过不去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_8a074efa:

    # "In the attempt to escape, you lost 30 health."
    "为了逃出去，你损失了30点生命值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_001621ee:

    # "Fortunately, you escaped unscathed, but you believe that you can make it in...if you try again maybe."
    "幸运的是，你毫发无伤地逃了出来，但你觉得再试一次……也许就能进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_e3c61ec7:

    # "You make it through, rather easily."
    "你相当轻松地钻了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_dbd7a24f:

    # "Soon, you are at the other side of the hole, without the figure noticing."
    "很快，你就到了洞口另一侧，那个身影完全没有察觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_c55d1030:

    # "The Entrance to the cave seems to be blocked..."
    "洞窟入口似乎被堵住了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Loop_2dd49d8c:

    # msg "Do you want to leave the area, states of the dungeon will not be saved." nointeract
    msg "要离开此区域吗？离开后将不会保存地牢状态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6cc9490e:

    # "The hole is a bit too high up for you to reach easily."
    "这个洞口有点太高了，你很难轻易够到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b74e38d1:

    # "Despite this, you muster up your courage, and jump up for the entrance."
    "尽管如此，你还是鼓起勇气，朝着入口纵身一跃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c6111082:

    # "As your hands grab the tunnel's mouth, you feel it begin to give under your weight."
    "当你的双手抓住隧道口时，你感觉它开始承受不住你的重量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_62ae172c:

    # "Panicked, you begin scrabbling your way up, half pulling-half launching yourself up into the tunnel."
    "你惊慌失措地开始手脚并用地往上爬，靠着拉拽和蹬跃将自己送进隧道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_95f5d601:

    # "The tunnel's mouth is a good bit wider after all is said and done, but you've made it in."
    "一切尘埃落定后，隧道口已经宽敞了不少，但你也成功进去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a1f4d607:

    # "The cave-in seems to have loosened up some of the rock around here. Looking closely, you can see hairline cracks in the stone beneath you, fractures caused by the vibrations left by the cave-in."
    "这次塌方似乎让周围的一些岩石变得松动了。仔细观察，你能看到身下石头上细如发丝的裂缝，那是塌方留下的震动造成的断裂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6cf30ec1:

    # "Luckily for you, the rock above you seems perfectly stable, clearly unaffected by whatever made the rocks below susceptible to the crash."
    "幸好，你头顶的岩石看起来十分稳固，显然没有受到任何导致下方岩石容易塌落的因素影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5d429dd0:

    # "The tunnel goes diagonally down, a brief little thing. As you make your way down the increasingly claustrophobic tunnel, you begin to notice a gentle blue glow coming from in front of you."
    "隧道斜斜向下，短得很。你沿着这条越来越逼仄的隧道前行，开始注意到前方传来一阵柔和的蓝光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2bc3aa10:

    # "When you finally pop out on the other side of the hole, you find yourself in a large cavern, a ceiling perfectly black with moss but for crystals on the roof, gently reflecting blue light from the pond on the other end of the room."
    "当你终于从洞的另一侧钻出来时，发现自己置身于一处宽阔的洞窟中。长满苔藓的穹顶漆黑一片，唯有穹顶上的水晶轻柔地映照着房间另一端池塘散发的蓝光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_92d2131d:

    # "Despite being deep underground, you feel like you are looking at the night sky. It is a mesmerizing sight, lights dancing in the crystals unceasingly."
    "明明身处地下深处，你却仿佛正在仰望夜空。这幅景象令人着迷，光芒在水晶中不息地跃动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ac2d3b06:

    # "Snapping yourself out of your daze, you move forward to the source of light."
    "你从恍惚中回过神来，朝着光源走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_60c676f7:

    # "As you thought, it is the water at the end of the cave that emits light. Whether it is the water itself, or some tiny creature within, you cannot tell."
    "正如你所想，洞窟尽头的水在发光。究竟是水本身，还是其中藏着某种微小生物，你无法分辨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_54adc15a:

    # "You should go report this to Vurro and Wuldon."
    "你应该去把这件事报告给伏罗和伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_854a09b9:

    # "Moving towards the hole in the wall, you realize a small mistake you've made. It's fairly easy to go down a tunnel. The inverse cannot be said."
    "朝墙上的洞口走去时，你意识到自己犯了个小错误。沿着隧道往下走相当容易，可反过来就没那么简单了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3959010e:

    # "As you try to move back into the hole despite that, you soon find yourself stuck."
    "尽管如此，你还是试图钻回洞里，很快便发现自己卡住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c59ca116:

    # "You try to move backwards, backing out of the tunnel, but find you cannot, as the rock presses down against your sides such that your arms find little purchase to push yourself backwards with."
    "你试着向后移动，往隧道外退，却发现自己根本动不了。岩石从两侧压迫着你的身体，你的双臂几乎找不到可以借力的地方，无法将自己向后推去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d930a4d2:

    # "At that moment, you realize where you are."
    "就在那一刻，你意识到了自己的处境。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_62cec831:

    # "Trapped in a tiny tunnel inside of a cave prone to cave-ins."
    "你被困在一条狭小的隧道里，而这座洞窟又容易塌方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_86b23af6:

    # "Suddenly the minor pricks of stones poking into your skin stop being as unimportant."
    "突然间，那些戳进你皮肤的细小石刺，再也不显得无关紧要了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2ada0d44:

    # "The dearth of space, to the point of trapping your arms of head, makes your breath pick up as you fight against a rising feeling of panic."
    "狭窄的空间甚至卡住了你的双臂和脑袋，让你在对抗不断涌起的恐慌时，呼吸变得急促起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b2bcf265:

    # "Stuck as you are, and having no other recourse, you begin to yell for Vurro and Wuldon."
    "你被困在这里，别无他法，只得开始大声呼喊伏罗和伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a8e781cf:

    # "Soon, you hear the echoes of distant footsteps growing near."
    "很快，你听见远处脚步的回声逐渐靠近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_592c6690:

    # w "-ne?!"
    w "——你？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1d8aed5b:

    # e "I'm here! In the hole in the wall!"
    e "我在这里！墙上的洞里！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7a79c259:

    # "Your voice is deafening in your ears, echoing off of the tunnel walls."
    "你的声音在耳中震耳欲聋，不断在隧道壁间回荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5831190e:

    # "Upon hearing your voice, the boots approach even faster, until they stop only a few feet above your head."
    "听到你的声音后，那双靴子靠近得更快了，直到停在你头顶上方几英尺处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7be847b6:

    # w "Are you safe, little one?!"
    w "你还安全吗，小家伙？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f1ed9578:

    # "You've never heard the werewolf get this scared, he sounds nearly panicked with worry."
    "你从没听过狼人如此害怕；他的声音中满是担忧，几乎已经陷入恐慌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d6a70a0b:

    # e "Mmph. Mouth is full of dirt, and I'm stuck in a hole. Otherwise, I'm fine."
    e "呣呣。嘴里全是泥，而且我还卡在一个洞里。除此之外，我没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_de3eff2f:

    # w "No imminent danger?"
    w "没有迫在眉睫的危险？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_879634cc:

    # e "No."
    e "没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_68802571:

    # "You hear an exasperated sigh from above you."
    "你听见头顶上方传来一声不耐烦的叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2a874f44:

    # w "Please don't scare me like that again."
    w "请别再这样吓我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_deb1149f:

    # "There is nothing you can say to that."
    "对此你无话可说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_0842ff34:

    # w "Are you in danger?"
    w "你有危险吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e83f6bf0:

    # e "Not any immediate danger, no."
    e "没有什么迫在眉睫的危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b92dc53d:

    # w "That's good."
    w "那就好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9e33da31:

    # w "I assume you're just stuck?"
    w "我想，你只是被困住了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_09d52514:

    # "You try to wiggle your arms, and find once again your space is too small for you to even readjust slightly."
    "你试着扭动手臂，却再次发现这里的空间太小，甚至连稍微调整一下姿势都做不到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f6e7974a:

    # e "Yes, but it's really quite uncomfortable. Is there some way you could get me out?"
    e "是的，但真的很不舒服。你能想办法把我弄出去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1978becf:

    # w "It's possible to dig you out, but it would take a while."
    w "可以把你挖出来，但得花一阵子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c0e17316:

    # v "We could just leave him down there for a while to see if he learns."
    v "我们不如先把他留在下面一会儿，看看他会不会吸取教训。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4b91c5d5:

    # "It seems Vurro is here too."
    "看来伏罗也在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d15f6b5e:

    # "Judging from the dull thwack above you, it also seems that Wuldon has made very clear to Vurro what he thinks of the idea."
    "从你头顶上方传来的沉闷撞击声听来，伍尔顿似乎也已经非常明确地让伏罗明白了他对这个主意的看法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d978df91:

    # v "I was kidding, of course I wouldn't leave him down here."
    v "我开玩笑的，我当然不会把他留在下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_0a506840:

    # w "That's why I hit you softly."
    w "所以我才轻轻打了你一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f605e5d0:

    # e "Hey, can you two bicker later please? I'd really like to get out now!"
    e "喂，你们两个能不能晚点再拌嘴？我现在真的很想出去！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_731cb499:

    # "There's a brief pause. You can almost feel the two of them looking down at you from above."
    "短暂的停顿后，你几乎能感觉到他们两个正从上方低头看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e22ba4a8:

    # w "Maybe we should just leave him here."
    w "要不我们就把他留在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ff8c49a6:

    # e "Please don't."
    e "求你别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_12bab30b:

    # "You hear a soft snort from outside the tunnel."
    "你听见隧道外传来一声轻轻的喷鼻声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_785935a7:

    # w "Fine, fine. We'll get you out."
    w "好了好了，我们这就把你弄出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_716cc667:

    # w "Give us a second to grab our shovels – the ground here seems loose enough for us to dig you out easily."
    w "给我们一点时间去拿铲子——这里的地面似乎足够松软，我们很快就能把你挖出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9f09bd66:

    # e "Can you stay, please? I don't want to be left alone down here."
    e "你们能留下来吗，求你们了？我不想一个人被留在下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c83a13e1:

    # w "... Okay. I'll sit down next to the tunnel for you."
    w "……好吧。我就坐在隧道旁边陪你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_0a4b1a09:

    # "You hear a quiet shifting sound, followed by a soft whumph as the werewolf sits down."
    "你听见一阵轻微的挪动声，随后狼人坐下时发出一声轻柔的闷响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_70496631:

    # w "Sorry to trouble you, Vurro, but could you-"
    w "抱歉打扰你，伏罗，不过你能不能——"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ac37fc8b:

    # v "Don't worry about it, I'll go get the shovels."
    v "别在意，我去拿铲子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_333d60a7:

    # "You hear the other werewolf's footsteps grow distant. Soon, It's just you and Wuldon here."
    "你听见另一名狼人的脚步声渐渐远去。没过多久，这里就只剩下你和伍尔顿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_580403c9:

    # "Neither of you say anything. Despite that, you feel much safer. You can hear Wuldon's breathing, the small rustles of his movement."
    "你们谁也没有说话。尽管如此，你还是感觉安全多了。你能听见伍尔顿的呼吸声，以及他活动时发出的细微窸窣声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_0738f19a:

    # "You know he's here, and that he's staying vigilant for you."
    "你知道他就在这里，也知道他正保持警惕，守护着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_0fe4f290:

    # "Before you realize it, Vurro is already back with the shovels."
    "你还没回过神，伏罗就已经带着铲子回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_30f9e4e5:

    # "You hear the footsteps of somebody going to find the shovels."
    "你听见有人去找铲子的脚步声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5cbb563f:

    # v "Hey. I decided to stay behind and make sure you got out okay."
    v "嘿，我决定留下来，确保你能平安出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b1115493:

    # e "Shouldn't you be with Wuldon right now?"
    e "你现在不是应该和伍尔顿待在一起吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6a3c6911:

    # "You get the distinct feeling that Vurro is waving his hand at that, dismissing the thought outright."
    "你清楚地感觉到，伏罗挥了挥手，彻底打消了那个念头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_bceb1302:

    # v "He'll get the shovels for me."
    v "他会替我拿铲子的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_89b5ed4c:

    # "The two of you wait in awkward silence. You feel a rock digging into your stomach."
    "你们两人陷入尴尬的沉默，默默等待着。你感觉有块石头正顶着你的肚子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5589205c:

    # v "You comfortable down there?"
    v "你待在下面还舒服吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9e175e04:

    # e "No. I'd really prefer to be out of here, if I'm being honest."
    e "不。我说实话，还是更想离开这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9adc788b:

    # v "Well, you're gonna be down there for a bit. Do you mind if I ask you a serious question?"
    v "嗯，你还得在下面待一会儿。你介意我问你一个严肃的问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_09d94b0f:

    # v "I'd like to learn a bit more about the person who saved me."
    v "我想再多了解一点那个救了我的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_45808c0c:

    # e "Sure, I don't see why not."
    e "当然，我没理由拒绝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_616a093e:

    # "If you could hear a smile, you're pretty sure you did just now."
    "如果笑容也能被听见，你很确定自己刚才听到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5506c81a:

    # v "Great!"
    v "太好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_854aafac:

    # v "So, do you have any hopes for the future?"
    v "那么，你对未来有什么期望吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5fc16bf2:

    # "Starting out swinging, huh. Makes sense for a dead man, all things considered."
    "一上来就问这个啊。考虑到你是个死人，倒也说得通。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_47a9e1cb:

    # e "What do you mean exactly?"
    e "你具体是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_443b51d3:

    # v "Whatever you want it to mean, really. For example, is there something you want to have happen between the werewolves and Lusterfield?"
    v "你想怎么理解都行，真的。比如说，你想让狼人和卢斯特菲尔德之间发生些什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_371ac666:

    # "Yet again, Vurro is asking questions that you haven't really given much thought."
    "伏罗又一次问起了你从未认真思考过的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d46f5f38:

    # e "I... don't know."
    e "我……不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_afc2fa28:

    # v "Come on, there has to be {i}something{/i}."
    v "得了，肯定有{i}什么{/i}。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_de87e21d:

    # e "I want to know what caused the war with the goats. Why the magic is disappearing."
    e "我想知道究竟是什么引发了与山羊的战争，魔法又为何正在消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_58649503:

    # e "Why I'm here."
    e "我为什么会在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_51ea47d8:

    # "You hear a chuckle from above you."
    "你听见头顶上方传来一声轻笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4ce6e4fc:

    # v "I think Wuldon's coming back, so I'll keep it short, but..."
    v "我想伍尔顿要回来了，所以我就长话短说，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_25ed9f30:

    # v "I hope you figure it out."
    v "希望你能弄清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a387861f:

    # "Vurro straightens up, and leans against the wall. At least you think he does."
    "伏罗直起身，靠在墙上。至少，你觉得他是这么做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3711272b:

    # v "Took you long enough."
    v "你总算到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_113af265:

    # w "I'm going to hit you over the head with this shovel."
    w "我要用这把铲子砸你的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3a587ff2:

    # "Both voices are extremely close above you now. It seems Wuldon walked over without you hearing his footsteps."
    "现在，两道声音都离你头顶近得出奇。看来伍尔顿走了过来，而你完全没听到他的脚步声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d49b2f1f:

    # w "I'd recommend you cover your ears if you can. If not... my condolences."
    w "如果可以，我建议你捂住耳朵。要是不行……那我只能表示遗憾了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_44db0946:

    # "Having said that Wuldon grips his shovel and slams it into the ground at full force. At least, you hope it's full force, as the metallic clang that fills your ears makes it feel like it was your skull that was split in two."
    "说完，伍尔顿握紧铲子，用尽全力砸向地面。至少，你希望他确实用尽了全力——灌入耳中的金属撞击声，让你感觉仿佛是自己的头骨被劈成了两半。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3e519f96:

    # "Immediately following is another earsplitting peal, as Vurro's shovel hits the ground."
    "紧接着又是一声震耳欲聋的巨响，伏罗的铲子砸中了地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3b68b900:

    # "For hours, all you can hear is the banging of metal on stone, floor steadily making way for the werewolves."
    "几个小时里，你能听到的只有金属敲击岩石的声响，地面在一点点为狼人让路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_eb74b22a:

    # "As is smart of them, they dig diagonally down, using the cave's natural structure to reduce the work required."
    "他们这么挖很聪明：沿着对角线向下挖，利用洞窟的天然结构来减少所需的工作量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_12959514:

    # "Eventually, the tip of Wuldon's boot enters your view."
    "最终，伍尔顿的靴尖进入了你的视野。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4abb79e4:

    # e "Be careful for this part! You're getting close to me!"
    e "小心这一段！你们就要挖到我这里了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_36202dbc:

    # "All you get are tired grunts of assent."
    "你得到的只有疲惫的应答哼声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_17e78cd2:

    # "Even if the floor is weaker after the cave-in, it's still a fast pace, and enormous amount of work the two are undertaking for you."
    "即使塌方后地面变得更脆弱，两人为了你依旧挖得很快，付出的工作量也大得惊人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_10bf244a:

    # "Luckily, they're also nearing the cave you found."
    "幸运的是，他们也正逐渐接近你找到的洞窟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9f05b6d0:

    # "The sound of metal on rock is far gentler now. Their shovels still pierce the earth, but with a delicacy previously absent."
    "金属敲击岩石的声音现在柔和多了。他们的铲子依旧刺入泥土，只是动作比之前细腻得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3a5a6589:

    # "Your ears still ache, but there's room for thought in your brain now, your voice no longer drowned out by the scream of metal."
    "你的耳朵仍在隐隐作痛，但现在脑子里终于有了思考的余地，你的声音也不再被金属的尖啸淹没。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a9042998:

    # "The hole is still eminently uncomfortable, however. The closer the shovels get, the more dirt and stone falls from the ceiling onto your head."
    "不过，这个洞依旧让人极其不舒服。铲子越靠近，越多泥土和石块从洞顶掉到你的头上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_97bf0d94:

    # "Within the first 30 minutes, the first shovel breaks ground above you."
    "最初三十分钟内，第一把铲子便在你上方破开了土层。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_62e60f3f:

    # "Already you feel relief as a part of your prison breaks. You rotate your wrists gently, stretching your body where you couldn't before."
    "随着囚禁你的一部分土层裂开，你已经感到一阵如释重负。你轻轻转动手腕，舒展着此前无法活动的身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_69b7db16:

    # "Bit by bit the shovels uncover and more of you. First your hands, then your head, and finally, your shoulders."
    "铲子一点一点地挖出你的身体，先是双手，然后是头，最后是肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1e1e11b5:

    # "As soon as they reach a part of your body they can reach, the shovelling stops."
    "铲子一碰到能够触及你身体的部位，挖掘便停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e983b468:

    # "You feel a strong pair of hands reach down and tug you gently. It is difficult not to cry out in pain as your belly scrapes the ground, jagged pieces of rock dragging through your skin."
    "你感觉到一双有力的手伸下来，轻轻拉扯着你。腹部擦过地面，尖利的碎石拖过皮肤，让你很难不痛呼出声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5b0a2e91:

    # "Half of your body is out now. The hands continue pulling you, but another pair begins patting down your back."
    "现在你有一半身体露在外面了。那双手继续拉着你，另一双手则开始轻拍你的后背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3785103d:

    # v "You really need to be cleaned, you look like a statue."
    v "你真该好好清理一下了，看起来像座雕像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_379c25e7:

    # e "Having rocks and dust rain on you for hours on end will do that to you."
    e "石头和尘土连续几个小时落在你身上，当然会变成这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_8eb229a5:

    # "As your legs finally leave the tunnel, your body completely free of the tunnel, you find yourself thrown onto someone's - Wuldon - back like a sack of potatoes."
    "当你的双腿终于离开隧道，整个人彻底脱困时，你发现自己像一袋土豆似的被甩到了伍尔顿背上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e651ec1a:

    # e "It's alright! I'm out! I'm out! My legs still work, Wuldon!"
    e "没事！我出来了！出来了！我的腿还能动，伍尔顿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_604bd8f9:

    # "Wuldon begins running to the mouth of the tunnel, as if you had said nothing."
    "伍尔顿开始向隧道口跑去，仿佛完全没听见你的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4f6196fd:

    # w "I know, but you're filthy, and now we are too."
    w "我知道，但你浑身脏兮兮的，现在我们也一样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_dcfdd6b9:

    # "A confusing statement, but one you're too tired to argue with right now."
    "这话听起来有些莫名其妙，但你现在累得根本没力气争辩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4217a17d:

    # "The only sounds in the tunnel are the echoes of Wuldon's feet on the ground, a rythmic beat steady as the tick of a clock."
    "隧道里唯一的声音，就是伍尔顿脚步落地的回声，节奏稳定得如同钟表的滴答声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3854316e:

    # "It isn't long before you find yourself staring at the pool of water you entered from."
    "没过多久，你便望见了自己当初进入的那片水潭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1a7c45b3:

    # w "You good to go in?"
    w "你准备好进去了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_abc4599f:

    # e "You're not going to throw me or something?"
    e "你不会把我扔进去之类的吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_0090c603:

    # "Wuldon shakes his head, his fur brushing against your stomach."
    "伍尔顿摇了摇头，身上的毛发擦过你的腹部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b6536947:

    # w "I think you deserve a break. Being stuck in a hole isn't fun."
    w "我觉得你该休息一下。困在洞里可不好玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5b5d3a9f:

    # "A sigh escapes your lips as Wuldon puts you down."
    "伍尔顿把你放下时，你不由得叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d53a6b79:

    # e "It isn't."
    e "确实不好玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9091bd0b:

    # e "You werewolves seem to like the experience though."
    e "不过，你们狼人似乎很喜欢这种体验。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7a074a4b:

    # "It takes Wuldon a second to get it, at which point he laughs uproariously."
    "伍尔顿愣了一秒才听懂，随即放声大笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cb2364c7:

    # w "Some don't - I'm glad I've never had to deal with having a knot, that's for sure."
    w "有些狼人可不喜欢——我很庆幸自己从没遇到过锁结，这点毋庸置疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d80387a3:

    # "You raise an eyebrow at that as Wuldon swings his arm around your side, pulling you into a semi-casual half hug."
    "你对此挑了挑眉，伍尔顿抬臂揽过你的身侧，把你拉进一个半是随意的半拥抱里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d34f1092:

    # w "God knows it would make going multiple rounds or cuddling harder."
    w "天知道，这会让连着来上几轮，或者依偎在一起，都更难。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_22984b3a:

    # "As you struggle to find a proper answer to that, Wuldon lets go off you."
    "你还在绞尽脑汁想出合适的回答，伍尔顿便松开了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cd5b0928:

    # w "Well. Let's get clean, shall we?"
    w "好了，咱们洗洗，怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d402cd4f:

    # "The blue werewolf immediately cannonballs into the water, covering your entire lower half with water."
    "蓝色狼人立刻一头扎进水里，溅起的水花把你的整个下半身都浇湿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_209f2355:

    # "Inspired by this, you take a running start and do the same."
    "受此启发，你助跑一段，也做了同样的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_62952ca2:

    # "You can feel the rocks leave your fur as you meet the water. The initial dive was enough to return your skin to its brown color, rather than the dull gray of before."
    "当你入水时，能感觉到岩石从皮毛上脱落。最初的潜水已经足以让你的皮肤恢复棕色，不再是之前那种暗灰色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9cf795fd:

    # "Sinking down into the dark depths, you take a moment to rub your body, pushing loose more and more rocks until you feel acceptably rock free."
    "沉入黑暗深处后，你花了片刻揉搓身体，把越来越多松动的岩石弄掉，直到身上基本不再有岩石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1f21cbdc:

    # "Once done, you reach for the surface, swimming towards the torchlight."
    "做完后，你朝着火把的光亮游向水面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b5491e4e:

    # "Your head surges free of the water as you take a breath."
    "你猛地探出水面，深吸了一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ee558b92:

    # e "Won't we not be able to breath if you put up a torch?"
    e "你要是点起火把，我们岂不是没法呼吸了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2ef5ea12:

    # "The blue werewolf gives you a small shrug."
    "蓝色狼人轻轻耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_840880d4:

    # w "I made a hole in the ceiling, remember?"
    w "我不是在天花板上开了个洞吗，记得吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7964bb37:

    # w "Not sure if it's enough to supply three people and a torch, but only one way to find out, right?"
    w "不知道够不够三个人和一支火把用，但想知道答案，也就这一种办法，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f90b4630:

    # "Unconcerned by the look of horror on your face, Wuldon turns back to the tunnel they got you out of. After a few moments of shock, you give choice."
    "你脸上那副惊恐的模样丝毫没有影响伍尔顿，他转身回到那条把你们带出来的隧道。震惊了片刻后，你作出了选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_306508b6:

    # e "Hey, you're kidding, right?"
    e "喂，你是在开玩笑吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d9725aca:

    # "Wuldon gives you a lighthearted chuckle."
    "伍尔顿轻松地笑了几声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e2f9da0f:

    # w "What do you think, little one?"
    w "你觉得呢，小家伙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_288ed531:

    # e "That you're messing with me."
    e "你在耍我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2a660715:

    # w "Attaboy."
    w "好样的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_66a4b614:

    # e "Were you going to say that regardless of what I said?"
    e "不管我说什么，你都打算这么说，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e593ffb8:

    # "Wuldon grins mischievously, eyes shining playfully."
    "伍尔顿调皮地咧嘴一笑，双眼闪烁着玩味的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b56b3bd7:

    # w "Maybe."
    w "也许。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_bd557ac5:

    # "You get the feeling that's the most you're getting out of him, at least right now."
    "你感觉这至少眼下就是你能从他嘴里得到的全部了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c004858b:

    # w "So, anything of interest in that tunnel?"
    w "那么，那条隧道里有什么有趣的东西吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_41702f8a:

    # "You give your best smirk."
    "你露出自认为最得意的坏笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f1642409:

    # e "Maybe."
    e "也许。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2bf90d56:

    # w "Ah, that's a yes. Good."
    w "啊，看来是答应了。很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d7d98e72:

    # "Not responding is the best you can do to maintain even a shred of ambiguity. Even if Wuldon guessed correctly, he might still doubt himself."
    "你能做的，也只有保持沉默，留下哪怕一丝暧昧。即使伍尔顿猜对了，他或许还是会怀疑自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5ef4a8a1:

    # "The two of you eventually reach the tunnel's entrance, where a sleepy Vurro sits with his back to the wall."
    "你们最终来到了隧道入口，只见昏昏欲睡的伏罗背靠墙壁坐在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_bd087adc:

    # "Wuldon bends down and gently shakes his friend's drowsiness away."
    "伍尔顿俯身，轻轻摇醒了昏昏欲睡的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_bf14a88d:

    # w "Come on, we have to finish excavating the tunnel."
    w "快点，我们得把隧道挖完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_bcbcf61a:

    # "A halfway alert Vurro complies with his friend's demands, getting up and grabbing a shovel."
    "半清醒的伏罗听从了朋友的要求，起身拿了把铲子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c249a61a:

    # v "You can rest for a bit, [e], the tunnel is almost done, and I want to be the one to finish it. Well, with Wuldon, I mean."
    v "你可以休息一会儿，[e]。隧道快挖通了，我想亲手把它挖完。呃，我是说，和伍尔顿一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_abe08ab0:

    # "The other werewolf rolls his eyes and strikes the ground without ceremony."
    "另一名狼人翻了个白眼，毫不客气地朝地面刨了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_10923144:

    # "Vurro rushes after Wuldon and begins to do his part as well."
    "伏罗连忙追上伍尔顿，也开始尽自己的一份力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ecba45f5:

    # "You drift off to the screech of the shovels, and the grunts of both werewolves pushing themselves."
    "你伴着铲子的刺耳声，以及两名狼人竭力干活时发出的喘哼声，渐渐睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_47f3b820:

    # "It's pretty awful background noise, but you're too tired to care right now."
    "这背景噪音实在糟糕，但你现在累得根本懒得在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_789ae6f1:

    # "The ground is softer than I thought..."
    "地面比我想的要松软……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a2cba0a2:

    # "Not... Compla..."
    "不……抱怨……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cfed2e52:

    # "The ground is back to being hard rock again, much to your chagrin."
    "地面又变回了坚硬的岩石，这让你十分懊恼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b117c302:

    # "You can't quite bring yourself to care. You're tired, and they found the cave. That's all that matters."
    "你实在提不起精神去在意。你累了，而他们也找到了洞窟。这才是最重要的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2f321537:

    # w "Finally waking up, little one?"
    w "终于醒了，小家伙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_06beacd0:

    # "He says this gently, as if afraid to disrupt your slumber."
    "他轻声说道，仿佛生怕惊扰你的睡眠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_23b271ca:

    # e "Mrrg."
    e "唔呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_46cc3b0c:

    # "Wuldon chuckles softly at your sleepy tone."
    "伍尔顿被你困倦的声音逗得轻轻笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a3310f81:

    # "Looking over, you see him by your side, looking up at the roof of the cavern."
    "你扭头一看，发现他就在你身旁，正抬头望着洞窟顶部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9e816633:

    # w "It's a beautiful place you found here, little one."
    w "你在这里找到的地方真美啊，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_01aa1423:

    # w "This is what I meant when I called you a lucky charm."
    w "这就是我称你为幸运护符时所指的意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f5309ad4:

    # "You shift a bit on the floor, trying to find a softer spot."
    "你在地面上挪动了一下，试图找到更柔软的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1e2c4240:

    # e "mrrf. Thanks..."
    e "嗯哼。谢谢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f4cba0cd:

    # "You stretch a bit, trying to work out the tension in your back. A few pops later, and your body floods with relief."
    "你伸了伸身子，试图舒缓背部的紧绷感。几声关节作响后，身体顿时涌起一阵舒畅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4fdda857:

    # w "Looks like you're having trouble sleeping on the ground."
    w "看来你不太习惯睡在地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e4b2888b:

    # "The werewolf shifts closer, so that your shoulder and his just barely don't touch."
    "狼人挪近了些，你的肩膀与他的肩膀几乎就要碰到，却又恰好没有碰上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e8953bbc:

    # w "You mind if I help with that?"
    w "你介意我帮忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2cedc68f:

    # "Rather than speak, your response is to shift closer to Wuldon."
    "你没有开口，而是向伍尔顿挪近了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_287cee54:

    # "Wuldon shifts his body to face you, a small smile telling you all you need to know."
    "伍尔顿转过身面对你，脸上那抹淡淡的微笑已经说明了一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_91ecc23b:

    # "The blue werewolf wraps his arm across your front, as his other arm moves lower and grabs you by the legs."
    "蓝色的狼人伸出一只手臂横过你的身前，另一只手臂则往下移，抓住了你的双腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_82be1317:

    # w "Here."
    w "来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a0bc3f2d:

    # "Wuldon picks you up gently, and slowly pulls you flush against his chest, ready to let go if you make even the slightest protest."
    "伍尔顿轻轻抱起你，慢慢将你拉到胸前贴紧，哪怕你稍有一丝抗拒，他都会立刻松手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9b93fcf1:

    # "Letting it happen, you find yourself tucked next to the werewolf, his chin resting on your head between your horns."
    "任由他抱着，你发现自己被安置在狼人身旁，他的下巴搁在你的头顶，两只角之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_93aaab83:

    # "He's warm. From his soft belly to the muscley arm you use as a pillow, his entire body radiates heat, a roaring hearth in the body of a man."
    "他身上暖烘烘的。从柔软的腹部，到被你当作枕头的结实手臂，他的整个身体都散发着热量，宛如一个男人身躯中的熊熊炉火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_79edddef:

    # "His other arm rests around your belly, hand idly scratching the fur within its reach."
    "他的另一只手臂环在你的腹部，手掌漫不经心地挠着够得着的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b89ec288:

    # w "Better?"
    w "好些了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6628e018:

    # "He already knows, but he wants to hear you say it. For pride, or to tease you, you can't tell."
    "他早就知道答案，却还是想听你亲口说出来。是为了满足自尊，还是想逗逗你，你也说不准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a38c9e6e:

    # "Too tired for words, you just nuzzle closer to Wuldon."
    "你累得连话都不想说，只是向伍尔顿又蹭近了一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_18075836:

    # "It seems this is answer enough for him, as he lets out a contented sigh above you."
    "看来这已经足够成为回答，他在你头顶发出一声满足的叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3ad2bfa1:

    # "You hate to break the happy silence, but you had a few questions to ask the big wolf."
    "你实在不愿打破这份愉快的寂静，可你还有几个问题想问这头大狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_27cd17eb:

    # "At least he can still hold you as he answers."
    "至少，他回答时还抱得住你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5d70a179:

    # e "Sorry, I think it'd be better to try and figure it out on my own."
    e "抱歉，我觉得还是自己想办法弄清楚比较好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a4011cb9:

    # "The werewolf's content expression looks strained as you say that."
    "你说出这话时，狼人原本满足的表情看起来有些僵硬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6f73479c:

    # w "Alright. Good luck with that."
    w "好吧。祝你好运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_eb175b65:

    # "He shifts back to where he was."
    "他挪回了原来的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7fc8eccc:

    # "Quietly, you speak back up, each word a challenge to form."
    "你轻声再次开口，每个字都仿佛要费尽力气才能说出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_fc21b246:

    # e "Wuldon... where's Vurro."
    e "伍尔顿……伏罗在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_818653e1:

    # w "He's checking out the minerals in the area."
    w "他正在查看附近的矿物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_36a3fc58:

    # w "They're fairly promising, apparently."
    w "看起来颇有希望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a638a145:

    # "This is punctuated by a massive yawn."
    "话音落下，他打了个大大的哈欠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_e039e74d:

    # e "We... oof. We sleeping here?"
    e "我们……呃。要在这儿睡吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_82ff00ca:

    # w "We were planning to. It's alright if you have things to attend to."
    w "我们本来就打算这么做。你要是还有事要处理，也没关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_8099357d:

    # "Even if you wanted, you're too tired to go do them. It's been a long day."
    "就算你想去处理，也累得没力气去了。今天可真够漫长的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a9a6a397:

    # e "mrrg."
    e "唔呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6f9f1db8:

    # w "Agreed."
    w "说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f1ede524:

    # "Despite saying that, the two of you keep your eyes open for a bit, drinking in the mood."
    "虽说这么说，你们还是睁着眼睛待了一会儿，静静感受着这份氛围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c18f640d:

    # "It was hard not to, considering the warm, hard lump poking into your back."
    "考虑到那温热而坚硬的东西正抵着你的后背，你很难继续闭着眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_02a72d67:

    # "Neither of you outright acknowledged it or your own erection, not willing to do more than flirt right now, tired as you are."
    "你们谁也没有明说那件事，也没有承认自己的勃起；你们现在都累得厉害，不愿做出调情之外的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ff92cae2:

    # "Of course, Wuldon didn't quite let you go to sleep without telling you he knew, as his hand drifted further and further down your belly, until it occasionally brushed your tip when he scratched you."
    "当然，伍尔顿可没让你安然入睡而不告诉你他知道这件事：他的手沿着你的腹部越来越往下，在挠你时，偶尔会擦过你的龟头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4b2c9838:

    # "The only revenge you could get on the werewolf was readjusting slightly every so often to tug on his shaft a bit."
    "你能对狼人做的唯一报复，就是时不时稍微调整姿势，轻轻扯动他的阴茎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f7e4dd5e:

    # "Every time you did, Wuldon would let out a small growl and hump gently into your back."
    "每次你这么做，伍尔顿都会发出一声轻微的低吼，用胯部轻轻顶着你的后背磨蹭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_27992cd5:

    # "Eventually, the two of you quiet down and return to cuddling without teasing."
    "最后，你们渐渐安静下来，重新相拥依偎，不再互相逗弄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a9a8f7de:

    # "You can tell Wuldon is holding himself back from going further right now - likely because of Vurro - but his body slowly relaxes as the gentle glow of the cave lulls him into drowsiness."
    "你看得出来，伍尔顿现在正克制着自己，不再进一步——大概是因为伏罗——但洞窟柔和的微光让他渐渐困倦，他的身体也慢慢放松下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ade813dd:

    # "It's like laying under the night sky, crystalline rocks sparkling with thousands of colors like the stars far above."
    "仿佛躺在夜空下，晶莹的岩石闪烁着万千色彩，如同高空中的繁星。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5e9dfc25:

    # "There is no moon to provide light, but the slight blue glow of the pond fits the role well, drowning the cave in calm."
    "没有月亮提供光亮，但池塘微弱的蓝光很好地替代了月光，让洞窟沉浸在宁静之中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ef129b57:

    # "You don't know when you fell asleep. One moment you were looking at the walls, and the next you were woken up by Wuldon affectionately nuzzling your neck."
    "你不知道自己是什么时候睡着的。前一刻你还在望着洞壁，下一刻便被伍尔顿亲昵地蹭着脖颈弄醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c93ba645:

    # w "As much as I hate to say it, we need to get going, little one."
    w "虽然我很不愿意这么说，但我们得走了，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ab28e3dd:

    # "So saying, he pulls away from you and gets on his feet."
    "说完，他从你身边退开，站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_af71426f:

    # "You don't know when you fell asleep. One moment you were looking at the walls, and the next you were woken up by Wuldon pushing you gently."
    "你不知道自己是什么时候睡着的。前一刻你还在望着洞壁，下一刻便被伍尔顿轻轻推醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1e7cdb55:

    # w "Come on, we should get going."
    w "来吧，我们该走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_8462893c:

    # "Still a bit groggy, you get up and stretch a bit to wake up."
    "你还有些昏昏沉沉，起身伸了伸懒腰，让自己清醒过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_50ed8b3a:

    # w "Vurro is at the cave entrance, sleeping."
    w "伏罗正在洞口睡觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1a4c232b:

    # "You look up at him in the middle of a stretch, feeling a bit ridiculous."
    "你伸展到一半抬头看向他，觉得自己有点可笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4ea1b3fd:

    # e "Any reason why?"
    e "有什么原因吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_128811de:

    # w "He wanted to give us room or something, apparently."
    w "看来，他是想给我们腾点地方之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_9bcab37b:

    # w "The snoring was the biggest reason for him, I think."
    w "我觉得，鼾声才是促使他这么做的最大原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c77cf443:

    # "Wuldon checks to see if you're ready to go, and turns towards the exit."
    "伍尔顿确认你是否准备好了，随后转向出口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_52e24e7f:

    # w "We should get going before his snoring causes another cave-in."
    w "趁他的鼾声还没引起另一次塌方，我们该走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_73d7b3cf:

    # "Together, you jog over to the water hole."
    "你们一起小跑到水潭边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f05954e4:

    # "Vurro's unconscious form comes into view far after you hear the snoring."
    "你们听到鼾声许久之后，才看见伏罗不省人事的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6c741e9e:

    # "He looks like passed out on his feet, considering the absurd heap he forms."
    "看他那副荒唐的姿势，简直像是站着昏过去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_efe8be86:

    # "Wuldon, apparently not caring for his condition, grabs Vurro and dunks him into the water headfirst."
    "伍尔顿似乎完全不在意他的状况，抓起伏罗，把他的头朝下按进水里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ebf38758:

    # "Vurro comes back out spluttering and indignant. He is put back down on the ground, where he spends a good minute sulking."
    "伏罗从水里冒出来，呛得直喘，还满脸愤懑。他被重新放回地面，闷闷不乐了好一阵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5b887d4d:

    # v "I know it's because it's hard to wake me up, but please don't scare me like that."
    v "我知道你是因为很难把我叫醒才这么做的，但请别这样吓我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3a7e4a9e:

    # "Wuldon shrugs."
    "伍尔顿耸耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_be988d7a:

    # w "No promises."
    w "我可不保证。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f2dfed0a:

    # "Vurro just keeps on looking at Wuldon."
    "伏罗只是一直盯着伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_0991b613:

    # w "Okay, okay, I'll move it down the list of ways to wake you up."
    w "好好好，我会把这个办法在叫醒你的方法清单里往后排。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_80c6eacb:

    # "Vurro looks for a bit longer, until he gives up and accepts it for what it is."
    "伏罗又看了伍尔顿一会儿，最终放弃，接受了这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_583cd602:

    # v "Alright. Well, now that I'm awake, I have a few things to say."
    v "好了。既然我醒了，那我有几件事要说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ce22499c:

    # v "First off, the cave is an incredible find. Not only can we invite other tribes to visit, some of the ore in that area is incredibly rare."
    v "首先，这个洞窟真是惊人的发现。我们不但可以邀请其他部族来参观，那片区域的一些矿石还极其稀有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cc712d78:

    # v "Second, I'm hungry. We need to head back home and eat."
    v "第二，我饿了。我们得回家吃东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f40cb36a:

    # w "What happened to our supplies?"
    w "我们的补给呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7f811e1e:

    # "Vurro scratches the back of his head, embarrassed."
    "伏罗尴尬地挠了挠后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3c8edb50:

    # v "I uhh... ate them."
    v "呃……我吃掉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_8ce062c7:

    # v "I got sudden and intense hunger pangs earlier, and next thing I know, I've eaten all of the food."
    v "我之前突然饿得厉害，回过神来时，已经把食物全吃光了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_91e4a95c:

    # "Incredibly concerning, but there's nothing you can really do."
    "情况实在令人担忧，但你也确实没什么办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_8ff58ff8:

    # e "So we're headed back home?"
    e "所以我们要回家了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cf359301:

    # v "Yes."
    v "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_74401855:

    # v "Sorry that I couldn't talk to you about what we mentioned earlier, but I guess when we meet to hunt Uffe is as good a time as any."
    v "抱歉之前没能和你谈起我们提到的事，不过我想，等我们见面去猎杀乌菲时再说，也算是个合适的时机。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_22e179b0:

    # "Doubtful, but it'll have to do."
    "不太确定，但也只能这样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cff0bbdc:

    # e "It's alright. I'm sure you'll tell me someday."
    e "没关系。我相信总有一天你会告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_31f2b853:

    # e "We could alwa-"
    e "我们总可以——"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1e6922af:

    # "A loud gurgle comes from Vurro's stomach, interrupting your thoughts."
    "伏罗的肚子发出一阵响亮的咕噜声，打断了你的思绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_85eaf53b:

    # e "Nevermind. Let's get you some food."
    e "算了。我们去给你找点吃的吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7f02fe7e:

    # "The three of you look at the water with slight dismay. There's nothing for it to get in, but the three of you have had enough water for a long time."
    "你们三人略带沮丧地看着水。没有容器可以装水，不过你们三人已经喝够水很久了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_14afba7d:

    # "Moving past the hesitance, the three of you take the first step home together and dive in."
    "克服了犹豫后，你们三人一起迈出回家的第一步，纵身跃入水中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_04137203:

    # "Conversation is sparse on your journey home, thoughts occupied by the events of last night, or plans to take down Uffe."
    "回家的路上，你们交谈寥寥，心思都被昨夜发生的事，或是击垮乌菲的计划占据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_1d31e0ee:

    # "Before you know it, you're back at Wuldon's house."
    "不知不觉间，你们回到了伍尔顿家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_26b34d99:

    # v "Well, I guess we part ways for now."
    v "好了，我想我们暂时要分道扬镳了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_6a109a94:

    # v "We'll be grabbing supplies or otherwise preparing to take down Uffe for the next few days. I recommend you do the same."
    v "接下来几天，我们会搜集物资，或做其他准备来对付乌菲。我建议你也这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_86ff6451:

    # v "When we're both ready, come back here to go out and kill the bastard."
    v "等我们都准备好后，回到这里，我们一起出去宰了那个混蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4dc52f08:

    # "Vurro walks up to you and throws his arms around you."
    "伏罗走到你身边，张开双臂抱住了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_61ba5ae3:

    # v "Wuldon and I have been friends since we were little. He was the brother I never had."
    v "我和伍尔顿从小就是朋友。他是我一直未曾拥有的兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_52dbd08d:

    # "You almost mention Uffe, but stop yourself. It's sad to see a brother disown another, but in this case, it's perfectly justified."
    "你差点提起乌菲，但忍住了。看到一个兄弟与另一个兄弟断绝关系令人难过，但这一次，这么做完全情有可原。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4ae3a0b4:

    # v "Thank you for helping us, and for giving Wuldon company."
    v "谢谢你帮助我们，也谢谢你陪伴伍尔顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c1bc130b:

    # v "It means more than you know, and I wish I had some way to even start to pay you back."
    v "这对我的意义比你想象的更大，我真希望自己能找到哪怕一种方式，开始报答你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_88b608ff:

    # v "But I don't. So all I can say is thank you."
    v "但我没有。所以我能说的只有谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_37f7d903:

    # "You hug him back without a word. There is nothing you can say to that."
    "你一言不发地回抱着他。对此，你也无话可说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_5ac7dcbe:

    # "The two of you stay embraced for a long time, Vurro trying to make up for time he'll never have."
    "你们拥抱了很久，伏罗试图弥补那段他永远无法拥有的时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_2dc15d54:

    # "When it finally ends, Vurro backs off, looking... empty."
    "拥抱终于结束时，伏罗退开了些，看起来……空落落的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_fa453b82:

    # v "I'll see you in a few days."
    v "过几天见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c19fea77:

    # "As he says that, he gives you a sad smile, and heads inside."
    "说完，他朝你露出一个悲伤的微笑，转身走进屋内。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_375e9e50:

    # "Wuldon is standing by the door somewhat awkwardly, a bittersweet smile on his mouth."
    "伍尔顿有些局促地站在门边，嘴角挂着苦乐参半的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b3b0fe34:

    # "He walks forwards until he's less than a foot away from you."
    "他向前走来，直到离你不到一英尺远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_516f9609:

    # "You look up at his face as it looks down at you. Gentle, is how you'd describe him right now."
    "你抬头仰望他的脸，而他正低头看着你。此刻的他，只能用温柔来形容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c1c4cb6f:

    # w "There is a lot I want to tell you."
    w "我有很多话想告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c7877a2f:

    # "His face scrunches up in pain."
    "他的脸因痛苦而皱成一团。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_92debfdb:

    # w "But I want to wait until after we fight Uffe. Otherwise..."
    w "但我想等我们和乌菲交战之后再说。否则……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_4fe238fc:

    # "You nod to him carefully, and beckon him down so you can whisper in his ears."
    "你小心地点点头，招手示意他俯身，好让你在他耳边低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_aa0c7cb0:

    # e "I understand."
    e "我明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c01e1536:

    # "So saying, you grab both sides of Wuldon's head and gently kiss him on the cheek."
    "你一边说着，一边用双手捧住伍尔顿的头，在他脸颊上轻轻吻了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_77aa761b:

    # "When you pull back, Wuldon stays there, looking at you sadly."
    "你退开后，伍尔顿仍站在原地，悲伤地望着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_b5c9b02b:

    # w "You do."
    w "你会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_19f2655c:

    # "The blue werewolf sighs as he stands back up."
    "蓝色的狼人叹了口气，重新站直身子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_c4990880:

    # w "Stay safe. For both of us."
    w "一定要平安。为了我们俩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_35a572e0:

    # "You give him a sad smile."
    "你朝他露出一个悲伤的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7cfd1808:

    # e "I thought you said you'd keep me safe?"
    e "我以为你说过会保护我的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_a603ee09:

    # w "I said I'd try."
    w "我说过我会尽力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7b5add91:

    # "He pauses momentarily, gathering his thoughts."
    "他短暂地停顿了一下，整理着思绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ded60609:

    # w "I wish I could promise I will."
    w "我真希望能向你保证，我会做到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ad944cdb:

    # "With great difficulty, you give him a reassuring smile."
    "你费了很大力气，才朝他露出一个令人安心的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3445e722:

    # e "You do your best. Vurro and I know that."
    e "你已经尽力了。这一点，伏罗和我都知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_23be8d4c:

    # "With a heavy heart, Wuldon turns around."
    "伍尔顿怀着沉重的心情转过身去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cfbcb80c:

    # w "I know. But my best doesn't do much if my best friend is slated to die, and all I can do is watch."
    w "我知道。但如果我最好的朋友注定要死，而我能做的只有眼睁睁看着，那么我再怎么努力也无济于事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_72a33094_1:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_de0d00e1:

    # e "We brought him back for a while, and we're going to get revenge."
    e "我们让他回来了一阵子，而且我们会去报仇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f432ca3d:

    # "Wuldon pauses at the doorway. When he finally speaks, his voice is tired, but determined."
    "伍尔顿在门口停下脚步。终于开口时，他的声音疲惫，却很坚定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f8d21319:

    # w "Yes. I'm infinitely grateful for what I have, and I'll do my best to treasure it while I can. You've helped me do that, and now you're also helping me finish this whole thing."
    w "是的，我对自己拥有的一切都无比感激，也会尽我所能，在还能珍惜的时候好好珍惜。是你帮我做到了这一点，现在你也在帮我把这一切彻底了结。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_823e59d7:

    # w "We will get revenge, and I will hunt down whover did this and make sure he can't fuck with what's mine anymore."
    w "我们会报仇。我会把做出这一切的家伙找出来，确保他再也不能对属于我的一切下手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_97e88f0e:

    # w "For that to happen, we both have to live. Sharpen your weapons, stock up on potions... do whatever you can to get ready."
    w "要做到这一点，我们两个都得活下来。把武器磨利，备好药水……尽一切可能做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_905f9c94:

    # "Wuldon briefly turns to look at you again."
    "伍尔顿短暂地转过身，又看了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_48380a13:

    # w "I look forward to seeing you again when you are."
    w "等你准备好后，我很期待再次见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f3008618:

    # "And so, with a true, genuine smile on his face, Wuldon walked into his home, leaving you alone to process everything from the last few minutes."
    "于是，伍尔顿脸上带着真挚的笑容走进了家门，留下你独自消化刚才这几分钟里发生的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_3646a7e7:

    # "It's time to go home."
    "该回家了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_f02c0096:

    # "Wuldon is standing by the door somewhat awkwardly."
    "伍尔顿有些尴尬地站在门边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_54867737:

    # w "You know how I feel, but... thank you. Stay safe, little one."
    w "你知道我的心意，不过……谢谢你。小家伙，保重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_69a90bf7:

    # e "I will. Gotta stay strong to fight Uffe, right?"
    e "我会的。得保持坚强，才能对付乌菲，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_d73e09c8:

    # w "Yeah. It's going to be an uphill battle."
    w "是啊。这会是一场艰苦的战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_cf788e3b:

    # "Waving goodbye, Wuldon turns around and walks into his home, leaving you alone."
    "伍尔顿挥手道别，转身走进家门，留下你独自一人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_ca35251b:

    # "It's time to head home."
    "该回家了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Discovery_7cc84a7b:

    # msg "You received a level up point and 300 gold."
    msg "你获得了一个升级点和300枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Nosferat_80b59c53:

    # "You encounter a nosferat..."
    "你遇到了一只诺斯费拉特……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_a391ad25:

    # "Wuldon turns around from slamming his pickaxe into the wall."
    "伍尔顿把镐头砸进墙里后转过身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_af4a74f6:

    # "Looking at him like this, you think you can understand why the farmers were scared of him."
    "看着这样的他，你觉得自己能理解农夫们为什么会害怕他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_93ce62f4:

    # "His muscles bulge underneath his fur, which is matted with the dust and sweat of hard work in a mine. All of this contextualized by the sharp metal pickaxe in his hands, and the hole forming in the solid stone wall."
    "他的肌肉在皮毛下隆起，皮毛上沾满了在矿洞里辛苦劳作时留下的尘土和汗水。他手中的锋利金属镐，以及坚硬石墙上逐渐形成的洞口，更凸显了这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_060f6cf3:

    # w "You got any questions for me?"
    w "你有什么想问我的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_5db474b4:

    # e "Where do you think I should explore first?"
    e "你觉得我应该先去哪里探索？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_b91fd81b:

    # "Wuldon gives you a shrug, putting his pickaxe on the ground, and leaning on it."
    "伍尔顿耸了耸肩，把镐头放到地上，倚在上面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_d5ea2fc5:

    # w "I don't know. That's why you're exploring, to figure out if there's anything worthwhile in this part of the cave."
    w "我不知道。你就是为此来探索的，看看这部分洞窟里有没有什么值得一探的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_ed28b10c:

    # e "Anything else to keep in mind?"
    e "还有什么需要注意的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_34255009:

    # w "Try to take out any threats you see along the way. I don't think any will try to kill you, but they'll definitely inconvenience anyone trying to work here."
    w "沿途遇到威胁就尽量解决掉。我不觉得它们会试图杀了你，但肯定会给任何想在这里干活的人添麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_4357bfb3:

    # e "Alright. I'll be on my way then."
    e "好吧，那我先走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_918d29ca:

    # "Wuldon gives you a nod, hefting his pickaxe on his shoulder."
    "伍尔顿朝你点点头，把镐扛到肩上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_5bf98721:

    # w "Good luck."
    w "祝你好运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_d3e9d18d:

    # w "You're lucky I waived the viewing fees for you."
    w "算你走运，我没收你的参观费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_65eb36c3:

    # "You hadn't really realized you'd been staring. Wuldon doesn't seem to mind though, as he simply reaches out to ruffle your hair with a smile."
    "你都没意识到自己一直盯着他看。不过伍尔顿似乎并不介意，只是笑着伸手揉了揉你的头发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_774434f8:

    # e "Fair enough. I originally came here because I wanted to ask you something, though."
    e "也对。我这次来，本来是想问你一件事的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_f1d90117:

    # w "Hmm?"
    w "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_4ba05d5a:

    # "Wuldon puts down his pickaxe for now, giving you his undivided attention."
    "伍尔顿暂时放下镐，专心听你说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_5db474b4_1:

    # e "Where do you think I should explore first?"
    e "你觉得我该先去探索哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_bceabb6d:

    # "The werewolf fidgets slightly, giving the question genuine thought."
    "狼人微微坐立不安，认真思考起这个问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_fcc012ea:

    # w "I don't know. That's a lot of why we want your help exploring. You always seem to find something interesting."
    w "我不知道。这正是我们想请你帮忙探索的主要原因之一。你总是能找到些有趣的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_80e9ca7e:

    # e "So, I'm basically your good luck charm."
    e "所以，我基本上就是你们的幸运符。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_4b9d8911:

    # "Wuldon nods, slightly sheepishly."
    "伍尔顿有些不好意思地点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_0eacedc6:

    # w "That, and you can fit in the spaces we can't."
    w "还有，你能钻进我们进不去的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_c5a39378:

    # e "No other reason I'm here?"
    e "我来这里就没有别的原因了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_95934182:

    # w "...you're good at fighting, and clearing out the threats for us would be extremely helpful?"
    w "……你很擅长战斗，要是能帮我们清除那些威胁，那可就帮大忙了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_19303305:

    # "You shake your head, knowing he's dodging the question."
    "你摇了摇头，知道他在回避问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_4eb0adf8:

    # e "I know you can do all of this yourself with enough time and energy."
    e "我知道，只要有足够的时间和精力，你自己也能做完这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_d44bee6a:

    # w "That's... true. It's also not like I lack either of those."
    w "那倒……没错。不过，我也不是缺时间或精力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_09727994:

    # "He glances at Vurro."
    "他瞥了伏罗一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_b3ef7511:

    # w "Well, normally. Right now we're on a timer with Vurro."
    w "嗯，平时是这样。可现在伏罗的事让我们等不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_7e4918bf:

    # w "But yes, you're right."
    w "但没错，你说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_6c719bee:

    # e "Right about what."
    e "对什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_b83b8ab8:

    # "The two of you know exactly what you mean, but Wuldon seems embarrassed to say it with Vurro nearby."
    "你们两个都清楚彼此指的是什么，但伏罗就在旁边，伍尔顿似乎不好意思说出口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_690e28da:

    # w "That we want you here."
    w "是我们想让你留在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_815e4040:

    # "You narrow your eyes at Wuldon, who fidgets unhappily."
    "你眯起眼睛看着伍尔顿，而他正不自在地扭来扭去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_4e4f5c51:

    # w "Yes, he wants you here mostly because I want you here. Are you happy now?"
    w "对，他主要是因为我想让你留在这里，才希望你留下。现在满意了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_0f55e9ff:

    # e "As a matter of fact, I am."
    e "确实，我很满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_fcce1475:

    # w "...you're lucky I like you. Anyone else would have been laid flat by now."
    w "……你该庆幸我喜欢你。换作别人，现在早就被我撂倒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_e5aa2963:

    # "Satisfied with what you've gotten, you turn around with a smile."
    "你对得到的结果很满意，脸上带着笑转过身去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_0f3202da:

    # e "Good thing you like me then."
    e "好在你喜欢我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_025bb35c:

    # "If he can mess with you, you can mess with him."
    "既然他能拿你寻开心，你当然也能逗逗他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_5356a0a2:

    # "The last thing you hear out of Wuldon before you start exploring again is a vaguely annoyed grumble."
    "你重新开始探索前，最后听到伍尔顿发出一声颇为恼火的嘟囔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_0014f80e:

    # w "Didn't you just come here a second ago?"
    w "你刚才不是才来过吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_9f82fb28:

    # e "...Yeah. But I sort of forgot what I was looking for."
    e "……对。不过，我好像忘了自己在找什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_ff23bb65:

    # "Wuldon shakes his head in the bemused confusion of a man watching a dog chase its own tail."
    "伍尔顿摇了摇头，脸上带着看着狗追自己尾巴时那种啼笑皆非的困惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_ce987370:

    # w "I don't know if I'm hoping that this is caused by a monster hitting you in the head, or not."
    w "我都不知道该不该希望这是因为有怪物打了你的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_412d9d9d:

    # w "Both options have worrying implications."
    w "这两种可能都令人担忧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_af2cdd74:

    # "He's being a bastard as always."
    "他还是一如既往地混蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_77568443:

    # e "If it was the monster hitting me, it must have taken my memories of that too."
    e "如果真是怪物打了我，那它肯定也把我关于这件事的记忆一起拿走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_a2d61b4b:

    # e "Now, please. Remind me of my task?"
    e "现在就拜托你，提醒我一下任务？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_c16bfb9d:

    # "The werewolf gives a helpless shrug."
    "狼人无可奈何地耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_0d0c42dc:

    # w "You're exploring the nearby area for anything interesting, and clearing out any monsters you see along the way."
    w "你要探索附近区域，寻找有趣的东西，并清除沿途看到的所有怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_a144760a:

    # e "Got it."
    e "明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_de397181:

    # e "I'll talk to you later."
    e "我之后再来找你聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Wuldon_c2888060:

    # w "Mmh. Hopefully not about the same question."
    w "嗯。希望别再是同一个问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_f04e4f94:

    # v "Oh, hey there, [e]. Good to see you survived the few minutes alone with Wuldon."
    v "哦，嘿，[e]。很高兴看到你和伍尔顿单独待了几分钟后还活着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_33120eff:

    # "As you dry yourself off, you see Vurro looking around somewhat vacantly."
    "你擦干身体时，看到伏罗有些茫然地四处张望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_9fce886a:

    # e "Did the scouting go alright?"
    e "侦查进行得还顺利吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_698f37ff:

    # v "Mm. Yeah."
    v "嗯，没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_480bdadd:

    # "Vurro feels slightly... off."
    "伏罗感觉有点……不对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_82634624:

    # e "You doing alright there?"
    e "你还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_ff742d09:

    # "You get a gentle shake of the head from the brown werewolf."
    "棕色狼人轻轻摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_cf846ccb:

    # v "I'll be fine. It's just weird to be in this cave after everything that's happened."
    v "我会没事的。只是经历了这一切之后，再待在这洞窟里感觉有些怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_5d6c8add:

    # v "...I don't like thinking about how many of my people are buried down here."
    v "……我不愿去想，我的族人究竟有多少埋在这下面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_2a42b266:

    # "You both stand there in silence for a moment."
    "你们俩默默站了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_84c45187:

    # v "You know, even now, I'm scared that I'll turn down here."
    v "你知道，就算到了现在，我还是害怕自己会在这里变身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_b12985a0:

    # "It's hard to know what to say to that. Luckily, you don't have to. A nearly invisible blue arm camouflaged by the water reaches out, and grabs Vurro's leg."
    "这种时候真不知道该说什么。好在你也不用说。一条几乎看不见、借水色掩护的蓝色手臂伸了出来，抓住了伏罗的腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_0674c708:

    # "With a tremendous heave, Wuldon bursts out of the water, using his weight to pull Vurro down into the tunnel."
    "伍尔顿猛地发力，从水中冲了出来，借着自身重量把伏罗拽进了隧道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_8492bd8d:

    # "Wuldon lands sopping wet, but triumphant. He turns and waits for Vurro to appear."
    "伍尔顿浑身湿透地落了地，却满脸得意。他转过身，等着伏罗出现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_51c6c7f7:

    # "After a few short moments, an annoyed brown werewolf resurfaces, dry fur now returned to its soggy state."
    "没过多久，恼火的棕色狼人重新浮出水面，原本干燥的毛发又恢复成了湿漉漉的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_7e0af7a0:

    # v "You already threw me in once. Why do it again."
    v "你已经把我扔进去过一次了。干吗又来一遍？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_a2d8e44d:

    # "Wuldon gives a shrug."
    "伍尔顿耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_5ef4c3ae:

    # w "I could see that you were getting depressed again, so I thought I'd help you feel better."
    w "我看得出来你又开始消沉了，所以想帮你打起精神来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_65cabcbf:

    # v "..."
    v "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_dd6a31fe:

    # v "Fine. But you're going to explain what we're doing down here to [e] while I dry off."
    v "好吧。但我要擦干身子的时候，你得向[e]解释我们为什么会在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_78e712e4:

    # w "Fair's fair."
    w "一码归一码。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_9c521750:

    # "Wuldon turns to you."
    "伍尔顿转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_63f65e63:

    # w "Alright, little one. Our goals down here are to make an air vent, clear out some of the rubble disconnecting us from other areas, and find any sites that may interest us."
    w "好了，小家伙。我们来这里的目标，是开辟一条通风道，清理掉阻断我们与其他区域联系的部分碎石，并找找有没有什么值得我们关注的地点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_c146cfb1:

    # w "Vurro and I will mostly handle the first two, though he won't say no to extra help, if you want to give any."
    w "伏罗和我主要负责前两项，不过如果你想帮忙，他不会拒绝额外的援手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_0e1e5d72:

    # w "Your job will mainly be exploration. Having seen your performance in slime country, I have no doubt you'll find something interesting."
    w "你的主要任务是探索。见识过你在史莱姆之地的表现后，我敢肯定你会发现有趣的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_48549906:

    # w "Here's a pickaxe, you'll need it to get anything important."
    w "这是把镐子，想挖出什么重要东西就得用它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_b6cddd25:

    # w "Are we clear?"
    w "明白了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_ed7274fe:

    # "You give Wuldon a nod."
    "你朝伍尔顿点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_50f664fa:

    # w "Perfect. Please stand back."
    w "好的，请退后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_2898d4e9:

    # "Cautiously, you move as far away from Wuldon as you can. As soon as you cross some sort of invisible line, Wuldon begins to shake himself violently, spraying water everywhere."
    "你小心翼翼地尽可能远离伍尔顿。你刚越过某条看不见的界线，伍尔顿便开始剧烈甩动身体，水花四处飞溅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_efbd22af:

    # w "Good as new."
    w "好得跟新的一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_02140273:

    # "The Werewolf takes this opportunity to put down his pack and take out a pickaxe."
    "狼人趁机放下背包，拿出一把镐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_7fdacbf9:

    # w "Let's get going."
    w "我们出发吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_5e5915d7:

    # "The brown werewolf is turning around with a small boulder in his arms when he spots you."
    "那只棕色狼人抱着一块不大的石块转过身来时，发现了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_0d3fc131:

    # v "Hello [e]. Anything I can help you with?"
    v "你好，[e]。有什么我能帮你的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_74fe9d3d:

    # e "No, I'm doing well enough on my end. I was actually wondering if you wanted any help?"
    e "不用，我这边应付得来。我只是想问问你需不需要帮忙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_e9deefcb:

    # "Vurro gives you a small grin as he drops the boulder over in a growing pile to his left."
    "伏罗微微一笑，把那块石块放到左边那堆越堆越高的石头里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_c2523471:

    # v "I think I have things well in hand over here, but if you want to help, be my guest."
    v "我这边已经处理得妥妥当当了，不过你要是想帮忙，我也不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_62a32bc9:

    # e "Alright, how should I go about this then?"
    e "好吧，那我该怎么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_8ca10b84:

    # v "Just pick up rocks from that pile over there, and drag them over to the corner."
    v "你只要从那边的石堆里捡些石头，再拖到角落去就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_0a4ce564:

    # e "Sounds good. I'll stop when I need to take a break."
    e "听起来不错。需要休息时我就停下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_e19250f6:

    # v "Absolutely. We still need you exploring after all!"
    v "当然。毕竟我们还需要你继续探索呢！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_77eb8817:

    # e "I would, but I need to conserve my energy for exploring."
    e "我也想帮忙，但得留点力气探索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_c6174b6c:

    # v "That's alright! Thanks for checking in!"
    v "没事！谢谢你过来问问！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_e1a361f3:

    # "The smiling werewolf turns around and begins hauling rocks once more."
    "面带笑容的狼人转过身，再次开始搬运石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_cd962345:

    # "Maybe you shouldn't bother him again unless you want to help."
    "除非你想帮忙，否则最好别再去打扰他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_7f70bbca:

    # "Vurro is wiping sweat off of his brow when you find him again."
    "你再次找到伏罗时，他正在擦拭额头上的汗水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_84ff3a7d:

    # v "You here to help?"
    v "你是来帮忙的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_55992b1f:

    # e "I'm a bit bored of exploring, so I think I'll hop on if you don't mind."
    e "我有点探索腻了，所以如果你不介意，我想搭把手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_7f34facb:

    # "Vurro looks you up and down, noticing your exhaustion."
    "伏罗上下打量着你，注意到了你的疲惫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_c8819342:

    # v "You look like you could use a break, [e]. Wuldon would tear me apart if I made you work more."
    v "你看起来该休息一下了，[e]。要是我让你继续干活，伍尔顿会把我撕碎的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_5d91811c:

    # e "Are you sure? Those rocks look pretty heavy."
    e "你确定吗？那些石头看起来挺重的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_772a32a7:

    # v "No, I insist, [e]. Go rest a bit or see if Wuldon need any help."
    v "不，我坚持，[e]。去休息一会儿，或者去看看伍尔顿需不需要帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_8228c5e2:

    # "All you get is a smile from Vurro, as he begins hauling rocks once more."
    "伏罗只是朝你笑了笑，便再次开始搬运石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_9fdc718a:

    # "Seeing that Vurro understandably does not want to waste time, you join him at once."
    "见伏罗显然不想浪费时间，你立刻加入了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_a2622cda:

    # "The two of you spend your time chatting and teasing, occasionally receiving a pebble to the back of the head by an annoyed Wuldon."
    "你们俩一边聊天打趣，一边干活，偶尔还会被恼火的伍尔顿用小石子砸中后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_e8bd2563:

    # "With that said, the two of you begin hauling rocks together, sharing small talk and laughing all the while."
    "说完，你们俩便一起搬起石头，有说有笑地闲聊着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_e7a0226f:

    # e "Sorry, I don't think I can really afford to right now."
    e "抱歉，我现在实在没法腾出时间来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_8ab8d3d9:

    # "A small grin from the werewolf tells you he doesn't mind."
    "狼人微微一笑，告诉你他并不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_b6d4813e:

    # v "Alright, but make sure to come here and tell me if anything cool happens, alright?"
    v "好吧，但要是发生了什么有趣的事，记得过来告诉我，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_1bfe657f:

    # "He pauses for a moment."
    "他停了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_5dfb2795:

    # v "Or scream if you're in trouble."
    v "要是遇到麻烦，就大声喊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Vurro_bd5b0267:

    # "Deciding his break is over, Vurro begins hauling rocks once more."
    "伏罗决定休息结束了，于是再次开始搬运石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Cave_Help_e8bd2563:

    # "With that said, the two of you begin hauling rocks together, sharing small talk and laughing all the while."
    "说完，你们俩便一起搬起石头，有说有笑地闲聊着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Cave_Help_6c7e25f6:

    # "Your time hauling rocks with Vurro has dealt 50 HP damage."
    "你和伏罗搬石头的这段时间让你损失了50点生命值。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Cave_Help_4e57787f:

    # "Despite that, the cave's water has soothed the aching in your muscles slightly as you drink from it. You gained 200 EXP."
    "尽管如此，你喝下洞窟里的水后，肌肉的酸痛还是稍微舒缓了些。你获得了200点经验。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Cave_Help_91f1d522:

    # msg "You are now Level [pc.level]! Check your inventory to allocate your level points."
    msg "你现在是[pc.level]级！查看你的物品栏，以分配升级点数。"

translate schinese_rewrite Vurro_Cave_Help_ece49167:

    # "You also pick up a slate rock."
    "你还捡起了一块板岩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ward_a30ae46e:

    # "You look at the pulsating rock in front of you..."
    "你看着面前那块脉动的岩石……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ward_63309e96:

    # "It's weird that the rock activated by the flowing water is seen here also..."
    "被流动的水激活的岩石居然也出现在这里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ward_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore1_1fdf53f3:

    # "You stare at the ore vein, there seems to be some minerals inside the wall..."
    "你盯着矿脉，墙壁里面似乎有些矿物……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore1_f0ce74f4:

    # "However, you do not have the tool to extract the ore..."
    "然而，你没有提取矿石的工具……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore1_d9888168:

    # "You take out your pickaxe and start striking it against the ore."
    "你拿出十字镐，开始朝矿石上敲打。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore1_636e0bac:

    # "After a few long and grueling moments, you finally obtain an iron ore."
    "经过一阵漫长而艰苦的敲凿，你终于获得了一块铁矿石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore1_8d7da241:

    # "There's nothing for you to mine for now... Maybe the ore will replenish... eventually."
    "现在没什么可供你开采的了……也许这处矿脉最终会重新生成……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore2_1fdf53f3:

    # "You stare at the ore vein, there seems to be some minerals inside the wall..."
    "你盯着矿脉，墙壁里面似乎有些矿物……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore2_f0ce74f4:

    # "However, you do not have the tool to extract the ore..."
    "然而，你没有提取矿石的工具……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chelforte_Cavern_Ore2_d9888168:

    # "You take out your pickaxe and start striking it against the ore."
    "你拿出十字镐，开始敲击矿石。"

